        "TileImage": "$($repository bb15423f-bc60-4c49-ae0b-ee0a8843cbcc).Image",
        "Description": "47, new client — the Mayor of Sapienza, if you can believe it. Doesn&apos;t like non-conformists. Doesn&apos;t like &quot;weirdos.&quot; Thinks our targets&apos; forms of self-expression are controversial and dragging the town&apos;s image down. Wants them gone, quietly, to keep the tourists happy.\rOh — and the client requested it all be completed with a plague doctor costume if possible. They seem to be a stickler for the poetic.\rGood Luck.",
